opener\" target=\"_blank\">@cryptoquant_com</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Nov 4</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2117997284797657108\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2117286910997450976\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2117286910997450976.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">derivatives</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Perpetual futures sellers drove the slide below $80k while longs keep paying funding and options buyers add protection; spot buyers held steady.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2117286910997450976\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Nov 2</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2117286910997450976\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2117252467947950109\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2117252467947950109.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Sellers below $80k logged the longest run of daily net realized losses since mid-August, and earlier loss clusters formed at local lows.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2117252467947950109\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Nov 2</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2117252467947950109\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2117189797366174016\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2117189797366174016.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">About $707 billion of capital in bitcoin sits at a loss versus $380 billion in profit, and clearing that overhang usually takes months.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2117189797366174016\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Nov 2</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2117189797366174016\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
